{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435530/extras/GameTitle.png?t=1740742607\" /><br><br><strong>Double Dangerous</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready to lock, load, and double the chaos! Double Dangerous is a high-octane third-person shooter that flips the script on traditional gameplay. Wield dual guns and unleash a storm of bullets in any direction\u2014regardless of where your character is facing. Run forward while blasting behind you, pull off wild one-arm shots, or take down enemies mid-dive in slow motion. The choice is yours, and the fun is limitless.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435530/extras/DDGif1c.gif?t=1740742607\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Innovative Shooting Mechanics: Aim and fire freely in all directions, adding strategy and flair to every firefight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 Unique Worlds: Explore diverse environments, each packed with vibrant visuals and dynamic challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Four Difficulty Modes: From Easy to the insane \u201cNuts\u201d mode, push your skills to the limit with extra missions and escalating intensity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Medals and Unlockable Items: Earn medals in every mode to unlock exclusive skins and customization options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arcade-Inspired Style: Enjoy a blend of cartoonish charm and sleek realism, brought to life with stunning lighting and dynamic sound effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435530/extras/DDGif2.gif?t=1740742607\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you\u2019re a casual player looking for a good time or a hardcore gamer chasing the ultimate challenge, Double Dangerous delivers non-stop action, endless replay-ability, and the satisfaction of outgunning the odds.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435530/extras/DDGif4.gif?t=1740742607\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Earn 1 Bronze Medal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3435530/2c4d7c78ac24ebbcc9e93f4a6b3e9211085f3852.jpg"},{"name":"Earn 2 Bronze Medals","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3435530/26140c412edf5a5c5e4f51d5edd5b63413b478a9.jpg"},{"name":"Earn 3 Bronze Medals","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3435530/7dde15f6d3a9f4f49898a2afd1746c05e780a2fb.jpg"},{"name":"Earn 4 Bronze Medals","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3435530/23d7fdf250b0e843234550bb041c09bd6149abdd.jpg"},{"name":"Earn 6 Bronze Medals","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3435530/cc61b47dcd1fd0ebb82578454db9d8bf59f0acd0.jpg"},{"name":"Earn 8 Bronze Medals","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3435530/c481a4880b2b997788302ea4f8f485a73c257220.jpg"},{"name":"Earn 10 Bronze Medals","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3435530/71264bfd21dcba8d6e930370a0b8ff245e9b5e0d.jpg"},{"name":"Earn 2 Silver Medals","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3435530/589c81f1893a530c64df0dd62dd1b721293f2c57.jpg"},{"name":"Earn 4 Silver Medals","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3435530/ada170fe350388680d7d9b26300b637af76f5200.jpg"},{"name":"Earn 6 Silver Medals","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3435530/df50c3def0e1ae6d8069f789461b58d720265977.jpg"}],"total":22},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstati